{"id":"697a20da4e8b5","content":"{\"questions\":\"Get consignment orders by customer with totals\",\"answer\":\"\\t\\tSELECT \\n\\t\\t\\tcustomers.id AS iCustomerID,\\n\\t\\t\\tcustomers.company AS strCustomerName,\\n\\t\\t\\tCOUNT(DISTINCT s_order_main.id) AS iConsignmentOrderCount,\\n\\t\\t\\tSUM(s_order_consignment_pending.qty) AS iTotalPendingQty\\n\\t\\tFROM s_order_main\\n\\t\\tINNER JOIN customers ON customers.id = s_order_main.customer_id\\n\\t\\tLEFT JOIN s_order_consignment_pending ON s_order_consignment_pending.s_order_main_id = s_order_main.id\\n\\t\\t\\t&& s_order_consignment_pending.is_deleted = 0\\n\\t\\tWHERE s_order_main.status = 'consignment'\\n\\t\\tGROUP BY customers.id, customers.company\\n\\t\\tORDER BY iConsignmentOrderCount DESC;\"}","embedding":[-0.006027616,0.032230783,-0.027304318,0.039829236,0.028974306,-0.01352691,0.03191766,0.04972392,-0.061956584,0.040246733,0.05076766,-0.04187497,-0.023692967,0.0031364479,-0.068135545,0.03573776,-0.018630814,0.02916218,-0.009748559,-0.02976755,0.025028957,0.081370205,0.050016165,-0.001297503,0.02709557,0.01734701,-0.024319213,-0.0019883304,-0.0069513284,-0.019142248,-0.033441525,0.04780343,0.0092371255,-0.068135545,-0.03634313,-0.01941362,-0.034589645,-0.027116444,-0.005283949,-0.00308687,0.006085022,0.004931686,-0.008647411,0.030727794,-0.02916218,-0.0074940748,-0.017273948,0.026239699,-0.03143754,0.012963288,0.0005270902,-0.03542464,-0.057531115,-0.014372341,-0.014998587,0.0037940058,0.0071913893,-0.0047124997,0.05536013,0.013662596,-0.053189144,-0.043670207,0.00091197045,0.037303377,-0.038451493,0.030811295,-0.0336294,0.05677962,0.060912844,-0.0043393616,-0.0013907875,-0.0106513975,0.05540188,0.12074019,0.0029877145,0.011669047,0.08099446,-0.048680175,0.04663444,0.03285703,-0.0019609323,0.0528969,0.0028207155,0.0447557,0.032439534,0.00909622,-0.08341594,-0.11247375,-0.036092635,-0.029642303,0.015457834,-0.006998297,0.018996123,0.012629291,0.04947342,0.01238923,-0.016470265,-0.0019922445,0.020175552