{"id":"697a20daa0b94","content":"{\"questions\":\"Find pending consignment entries by date range\",\"answer\":\"\\t\\tSELECT \\n\\t\\t\\ts_order_consignment_pending.id AS iPendingConsignmentID,\\n\\t\\t\\ts_order_consignment_pending.type AS strType,\\n\\t\\t\\ts_order_consignment_pending.qty AS iQty,\\n\\t\\t\\ts_order_consignment_pending.sales_price AS fSalesPrice,\\n\\t\\t\\ts_order_consignment_pending.date AS dtConsignmentDate,\\n\\t\\t\\ts_order_main.order_no AS iOrderNo,\\n\\t\\t\\tcustomers.company AS strCustomerName\\n\\t\\tFROM s_order_consignment_pending\\n\\t\\tINNER JOIN s_order_main ON s_order_main.id = s_order_consignment_pending.s_order_main_id\\n\\t\\tINNER JOIN customers ON customers.id = s_order_main.customer_id\\n\\t\\tWHERE s_order_consignment_pending.date >= '2024-01-01'\\n\\t\\t\\t&& s_order_consignment_pending.date <= '2024-12-31'\\n\\t\\t\\t&& s_order_consignment_pending.is_deleted = 0\\n\\t\\tORDER BY s_order_consignment_pending.date DESC;\"}","embedding":[-0.026296074,0.032409493,-0.016257087,0.06293471,0.034691554,-0.014194855,0.0070398524,0.05581635,-0.054978892,0.014624051,0.05292713,-0.04162149,-0.005521966,-0.010557162,-0.054602038,0.045138802,0.004362615,0.042082094,-0.0055952435,-0.023574347,-0.0068775956,0.06708011,0.05447642,-0.011473128,0.026107647,0.0027976218,-0.025291128,0.015011373,-0.0065321457,0.0075161546,0.0077883275,0.029499337,0.049954165,-0.045766894,-0.04451071,-0.002758366,0.0030619432,0.0101332,-0.02194131,-0.019680182,-0.018863665,0.009023573,-0.04815364,0.032388557,-0.044594456,0.014979969,0.05799373,-0.00900787,0.005053515,0.0015191949,0.0012457137,-0.021920374,-0.029478401,-0.014487964,-0.012279178,0.00096307276,-0.005071834,-0.015639463,0.009845325,0.0054434547,-0.010646141,-0.055941965,0.00029212772,0.0278663,0.012341986,0.020810746,-0.02661012,0.0283269,0.0239512,-0.017722633,-0.032325745,-0.049828548,0.061259802,0.12117968,0.04141213,-0.008746166,-0.002552928,-0.01238386,0.0025620875,0.03971628,-0.007081725,0.