{"id":"697a20db146d8","content":"{\"questions\":\"Calculate store cut amounts for pending consignments\",\"answer\":\"\\t\\tSELECT \\n\\t\\t\\ts_order_main.id AS iSOMainID,\\n\\t\\t\\ts_order_main.order_no AS iOrderNo,\\n\\t\\t\\tcustomers.company AS strCustomerName,\\n\\t\\t\\tSUM(s_order_consignment_pending.qty * s_order_consignment_pending.sales_price) AS fTotalSales,\\n\\t\\t\\tSUM(s_order_consignment_pending.qty * s_order_consignment_pending.sales_price * s_order_consignment_pending.store_cut \\\/ 100) AS fStoreCutAmount\\n\\t\\tFROM s_order_consignment_pending\\n\\t\\tINNER JOIN s_order_main ON s_order_main.id = s_order_consignment_pending.s_order_main_id\\n\\t\\tINNER JOIN customers ON customers.id = s_order_main.customer_id\\n\\t\\tWHERE s_order_consignment_pending.is_deleted = 0\\n\\t\\t\\t&& s_order_consignment_pending.calculation_type = 'store_cut'\\n\\t\\tGROUP BY s_order_main.id, s_order_main.order_no, customers.company\\n\\t\\tORDER BY fStoreCutAmount DESC;\"}","embedding":[-0.004688715,-0.0031596075,-0.02235018,0.05094833,0.007875726,-0.04844914,0.029420247,0.057612825,-0.043669995,0.04101735,0.02365458,-0.03957045,-0.03163444,0.0015839143,-0.022306336,0.045116894,0.011027113,0.03319095,-0.015685683,-0.040052753,0.0317879,0.008248411,0.071774885,-0.018513711,0.013427647,0.013789371,-0.03393632,0.00799082,0.020914245,0.030187542,0.004557179,0.049545277,0.023851885,-0.03939507,-0.044415366,0.0017154503,-0.005979413,-0.025233014,-0.000888554,0.012835734,0.0064781546,-0.0073112166,-0.05480672,0.009815884,-0.03472554,0.020859437,0.0005545755,0.017943721,-0.028017195,0.010988748,0.010692791,-0.008385428,-0.034374774,-0.011312108,-0.032401733,0.024268417,-0.005667015,0.017724494,0.03433093,0.040162366,-0.029792933,-0.046344563,0.023128437,0.044218063,-0.052000616,0.02194461,-0.03009985,0.06392656,0.047659926,0.0034062376,-0.011186052,-0.03196328,0.032993644,0.07896552,0.0062096016,0.0065439222,0.043428846,-0.037049342,0.05414904,0.07348485,-0.01704489,0.0514