{"id":"697a20ea5aedc","content":"{\"questions\":\"Check if newsletter emails were actually sent to a user (mail log)\",\"answer\":\"\\t\\tSELECT\\n\\t\\t\\tmaillog.id AS iMailLogID,\\n\\t\\t\\tmaillog.subject AS strSubject,\\n\\t\\t\\tmaillog.type AS strMailType,\\n\\t\\t\\tmaillog.added_date AS dtAddedDate,\\n\\t\\t\\tmaillog_receivers.to_email AS strToEmail,\\n\\t\\t\\tmaillog_receivers.is_sent AS bIsSent,\\n\\t\\t\\tmaillog_receivers.sent_date AS dtSentDate,\\n\\t\\t\\tmaillog_receivers.is_opened AS bIsOpened,\\n\\t\\t\\tmaillog_receivers.is_opened_date AS dtOpenedDate\\n\\t\\tFROM maillog\\n\\t\\tINNER JOIN maillog_receivers ON maillog_receivers.maillog_id = maillog.id\\n\\t\\tWHERE maillog_receivers.user_id = 666\\n\\t\\t\\t&& maillog.type = 'newsletter_received'\\n\\t\\tORDER BY maillog.added_date DESC;\"}","embedding":[-0.0087696845,0.013239718,-0.023372462,0.010242991,0.002693546,-0.0010623847,0.004773214,0.026118627,-0.024134172,0.080019616,0.029686635,-0.06719082,-0.06723091,0.010463486,0.008143279,0.05432193,-0.03784495,0.023853542,-0.014943542,0.022550616,0.012538143,0.044058897,0.043617904,0.02015524,-0.02886479,-0.007622109,0.023713227,-0.0058581494,-0.00939108,-0.056005713,0.014753115,0.047666993,0.024735522,-0.015474735,-0.019894656,-0.06394353,0.029646546,-0.014402328,-0.015264262,-0.026058491,-0.03435712,-0.05488319,-0.018381258,-0.010924521,-0.036060944,-0.0066549378,0.013149516,-0.036301482,-0.0023239665,0.005166597,0.033254642,0.010593778,-0.039729178,0.022109628,-0.047586814,-0.029927175,0.048188165,-0.080019616,0.02718101,-0.012167311,-0.00074479677,-0.010087643,0.048468795,0.05776967,0.029726725,-0.0033074238,-0.01521415,-0.009125483,0.011345467,-0.0058030253,0.00080493174,0.047626905,0.026760066,0.039268143,0.0053169345,0.018140718,0.035660043,0.02986704,-0.043176915,0.06378317,0.0300274,0.030789109,-0.03239271,-0.023492731,0.043497637,0.015434645,-0.039147872,-0.110648364,-0.05568499,0.021488233,0.008378807,-0.040370617,-0.01361055,0.018411